===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|court-martial}}
* {{l|en|courtmartial}}

===Etymology===
A {{calque|en|fr|cour martiale|nocap=1}}, hence the unusual order of adjective following noun.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|courts martial|pl1qual=formal|+|pl2qual=informal}}

# {{lb|en|legal|military}} A [[court]] where cases of [[military]] [[law]] are heard.
# {{lb|en|legal|military}} A [[trial]] before such a [[tribunal]].

